---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Use — Genshin Damage Calculator';
const description =
  'Terms for the free Genshin Damage Calculator: damage values are estimates only, no warranty, limited liability, and fan-project non-affiliation notices.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-shell section-pad">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-forest-600">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)] md:text-5xl">
      Terms of use
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-[65ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      By using Genshin Damage Calculator you agree to these terms. In short: the tool is free, provided as-is, for
      personal theorycrafting; damage values are estimates; and the project is an independent fan work with no
      affiliation to the game’s publisher.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[var(--muted)]">Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">The service</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      Genshin Damage Calculator is a free web tool that estimates damage output for characters in the game Genshin
      Impact using published in-game formulas. It is provided for personal, non-commercial use. You may not resell
      the service, misrepresent it as official, or use it to attack, overload, or reverse-engineer third-party
      services such as the Enka.network API.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">Damage values are estimates</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      Calculated numbers approximate in-game results using the official formula and community-verified data, but
      rounding differences, hidden buffs, enemy variants, and patch changes can cause real gameplay values to differ.
      Output should be used for planning and comparison, not as a guarantee of in-game results.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">No warranty &amp; limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      The service is provided “as is” and “as available”, without warranties of any kind, express or implied,
      including accuracy, availability, or fitness for a particular purpose. To the maximum extent permitted by law,
      the author is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the tool,
      including decisions made based on calculated damage values.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">Intellectual property &amp; non-affiliation</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      Genshin Impact, character names, artwork, and all related assets are trademarks and copyrights of their
      respective owners (HoYoverse, miHoYo, Cognosphere). This fan-made project is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
      or sponsored by them. Official game art shown in the tool is used for identification in a non-commercial
      context; rights holders may request removal via the <a href="/contact/"
      class="text-forest-600 underline underline-offset-4">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)]">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
      These terms may be updated as the tool evolves; the “last updated” date above always reflects the current
      version. Continued use after an update constitutes acceptance. Related pages:
      <a href="/privacy/" class="text-forest-600 underline underline-offset-4">privacy policy</a> and
      <a href="/about/" class="text-forest-600 underline underline-offset-4">about the project</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
